  <!-- EN: void-touched -->
  <AM_Structure_Horaxian.label>虚空之拥</AM_Structure_Horaxian.label>
  <!-- EN: Space to you is a sterile grid, governed by logic. But we perceive the truth—a boundless sea of nightmares beneath the facade. From its depths, a mind rules, its tendrils stretching from the abyss to bless those who heed its call. -->
  <AM_Structure_Horaxian.description>对常人而言，宇宙就像是受逻辑掌控的无垢之网。然而我们却察觉到了真相——埋藏于表面下的是浩瀚无垠的梦魇之海。某个蛰伏在其深处的无上智能统治着那里，祂的触手从深渊中蜿蜒伸出，为那些遵从祂召唤的人赠予祝福。</AM_Structure_Horaxian.description>
